
===== setup =====
world=/tmp/plannotator-jetbrains-demo-v7uxME
PLANNOTATOR_DATA_DIR=/tmp/plannotator-jetbrains-demo-v7uxME/data
HOME=/tmp/plannotator-jetbrains-demo-v7uxME/home (scratch; not ~/.plannotator)
stubs=/tmp/plannotator-jetbrains-demo-v7uxME/stubs (webstorm, rider only)
file=/tmp/plannotator-jetbrains-demo-v7uxME/project/src/retry.ts
PLANNOTATOR_BROWSER=/usr/bin/true
webstorm and rider are stub launchers: they append argv to launches.log and exit 0.
The review server and POST /api/open-in are the real ones.

===== command =====
$ ls -l /tmp/plannotator-jetbrains-demo-v7uxME/stubs
