-rw-r--r-- 1 ubuntu ubuntu   0 Nov 14 20:55 launches.log
-rwxr-xr-x 1 ubuntu ubuntu 291 Nov 14 20:55 rider
-rwxr-xr-x 1 ubuntu ubuntu 291 Nov 14 20:55 webstorm

exit 0

